Reverses a list. The output is Ok of the same items in the opposite order.
---

---
fn xs
	letrec rev = (fn (l acc)
		(if (= (@ l) 1)
			(Ok acc)
			(let h = (head l)?
				let t = (tail l)?
				rev t (cons h acc))))
	rev xs ~
---
~ => Ok ~ fuel 1000
[1 2 3] => Ok [3 2 1] fuel 1000
[7] => Ok [7] fuel 1000
